### Positive Findings

- ✅ `[GeneratedRegex]` used for both static patterns on .NET 7+ (L12, L16)
- ✅ `RegexOptions.Compiled` fallback for older TFMs with `static readonly` caching (L22, L24)
- ✅ `Concat(char, ReadOnlySpan<char>)` uses `stackalloc` — good pattern (L130)
- ✅ `string.Concat(ReadOnlySpan, ReadOnlySpan)` span-based helper (L119)
- ✅ `.Contains(char)` overloads used at L61 — no `StringComparison` needed

