### Summary

| Severity | Count | Top Issue |
|----------|-------|-----------|
| 🔴 Critical | 3 | LINQ chains in hot-path `FromPascalCase` (#1), `.All()` on string (#2), compound `Dehumanize`→`Pascalize`→`Humanize` re-processing chain (#7) |
| 🟡 Moderate | 4 | `.ToLower()` per-match allocation (#3), double-alloc on capitalization (#4), redundant regex (#5), `params` array (#6) |
